# ForgeBots — repo hygiene only.
# Build/test tooling (tsconfig, eslint, vitest, package.json) is added in
# Phase 01 of spec-kit/20-IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md — not before.

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db

# Build artefacts
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.log

# Environment / secrets — never commit (05-TECH-STACK.md § 8.4)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Godot 4 client (created when the project file lands in Week 5)
.godot/
*.tmp

# Generated artefacts (built from the route Zod schemas declared in
# 08-API-SURFACE.md — no section number: 08 is mid-revision)
server/openapi.yaml

# ── GPL material: must never enter this repository ────────────────
# Grobots side files. spec-kit/02-LICENSING.md § 4.1 forbids these
# outright — two were found sitting in the repo root on 2026-09-27
# (commune-10.gb, isi-33.gb) and were one `git add .` away from being
# committed. They are study material; they belong outside the working
# tree, not in .gitignore as an excuse to keep them here.
*.gb
*.gbx
*.gbk

# Grobots source archives, in case someone downloads one to "compare".
grobots*.zip
grobots*.tar.gz
Grobo*.app
*.grobots

# The same rule for any other GPL game source we might study.
# Add the project here the moment one is downloaded, not after.
